      "reading_order": 8,
      "text": "2. Dry ice undergoes sublimation by taking heat\nfrom the surroundings, thereby causing cool-\ning, which results in the condensation of water\nvapour and ultimately results in rain.\nHence, the correct option is (a)."
    },
    {
