      },
      "layout_tag": "paragraph",
      "confidence": 0.31829598546028137,
      "reading_order": 9,
      "text": "3. (i) $\\rightarrow$ (C)\n(ii) $\\rightarrow$ (D)\n(iii) $\\rightarrow$ (E)\n(iv) $\\rightarrow$ (A)\n(v) $\\rightarrow$ (B)\nHence, the correct option is (c)."
    },
    {
