        "y2": 866.0
      },
      "layout_tag": "paragraph",
      "confidence": 0.9234753251075745,
      "reading_order": 12,
      "text": "6. Except sodium and potassium carbonates, all\nother carbonates, on heating, decompose to\nproduce $\\mathrm{CO}_2$.\nHence, the correct option is (a)."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "20260317_a57b6c3c-dc4a-4dc6-aed6-d51df3870e67_9_block_012",
