      "confidence": 0.9012473225593567,
      "reading_order": 13,
      "text": "7. Baking powder contains sodium bicarbonate\nas a major component, which, on heating,\ndecomposes to release $\\mathrm{CO}_2$.\nHence, the correct option is (b)."
    },
    {
