      "reading_order": 14,
      "text": "8. A liquid $\\mathrm{CO}_2$ fire extinguisher works on the\nprinciple of evaporation of liquid $\\mathrm{CO}_2$ to gase-\nous state, thereby reducing the temperature of\nthe combustible substance.\nHence, the correct option is (d)."
